==Strategy==
After thwarting all of her malicious plans, the mastermind finally shows herself. This stage primarily consists of Angel threats with some occasional Mrs. Pengs as supports, so [[Barista Cat (Special Cat)|Silver Nyanko Ranger]] is a given. However, that won't be nearly enough anti-Angel firepower to hold off the onslaught.

Stall the initial enemies with slow attackers to give some time for [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to go off cooldown, then spawn your fast attackers once you're about to reach the enemy base. Once Vibon spawns, obliterate the opening wave of peons with Silver Nyanko Ranger (preferably with [[Commander Cat (Special Cat)|Gold Nyanko Ranger]] for Surge Immunity), [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]], and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]. Once you've got clear sights on Rain D., send out Awakened Bahamut Cat to barge into Vibon's blind spot and nuke both of them with his Explosions. He'll die when Mimon staggers, unfortunately, but he'll take Rain D. with him, allowing your [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cats]] to tank insane amounts of damage and hold the frontlines with the help of [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] (and optionally [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] too).

Boraphim should die right around the point that Puffzerker appears. This combination of enemies is no joke; Puffzerker and Vibon are more than capable of pushing you all the way back to your base. Thankfully, your Awakened Bahamut Cat will go off cooldown shortly thereafter, so just clear the field of peons and carefully time him into Mimon's blind spot. This will cause enough collateral on Puffzerker that a few good [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] hits can finish the job. The holy light of Vibon's forces shines nevermore, leaving all but a commander without her legion. A single Silver Nyanko Ranger can take care of the rest.

